// GraphQLStoreModelGenerator stamps one tagged value per list-typed argument that the underlying GraphQL
// field declares non-null (eg. `tags: [String!]!`), naming the argument - graphQLArgumentTranslator.pure
// reads these back to tell apart "the caller passed [] to omit this argument" (ambiguous for any other
// list argument under the full-call-arity convention) from "the caller passed [] because the required list
// is genuinely empty", which must still be rendered in the outgoing GraphQL request.
Profile meta::external::store::graphQL::generation::RequiredArgumentsProfile
{
  tags: [requiredArguments];
}
